@startuml
title Figure 57: Data Visualization Processing Flowchart of CCUN

start

:Start data visualization process;
:Import Moodle database dump;
:Store imported data in Postgres database;

:Understand Moodle data structure;
note right
  Identify useful data:
  students, courses, enrollments,
  activity logs, grades, completions
end note

:Select required analytics data;
:Clean data;
note right
  Handle missing, duplicated,
