if (Data ready for analytics?) then (Yes)
:Create analytics views and queries;
else (No)
  :Clean data again;
  :Transform data into analytics-ready format;
endif

:Backend processes statistics;
note right
  Examples:
  totals, percentages,
  distributions, trends
end note

:Return JSON response through Laravel API;
:Frontend receives analytics data;
:Render visualizations with Apache ECharts;
:Display summary cards, charts, tables, and reports;
:End data visualization process;

